  "idea": "Cal.com vs Calendly: which booking scheduler is better for your business",
  "text": "Comparing Calendly's established platform against Cal's developer flexibility highlights a major shift in scheduling software. Calendly offers polished presets, but engineers struggle to embed custom booking funnels inside proprietary apps. Hiding Calendly badges and routing dynamic logic requires pricey enterprise tiers and cumbersome middleware. Cal.com provides React embed libraries, custom CSS styling, and direct database webhooks out of the box. You deliver seamless white-label scheduling inside your product.",
